	(footprint "connectors:Mentor_1278.1004_LightGuide"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "7f00aac9-96db-4518-874f-1201c29b15b3")
		(at 202.44 148.95 180)
		(descr "Mentor 1278.1004 4-way horizontal bargraph light guide, press-in. Rotated 180 vs the datasheet drilling plan so the pipes exit toward -Y. Order (back->front): back wall (+Y) -> LED entries (Y=0) -> 3.8mm -> 2x M1.5 lugs (Y=-3.8) -> 4.3mm -> FRONT light-exit face with 4 windows (Y=-8.1, overhangs board edge to panel). LEDs = Osram Mini TOPLED M676, 2.54mm pitch. Datasheet ll14-36 / MENTOR_12781004.")
